WEBVTT

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:12.340
"Kodomo no Omocha"

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.870
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter
feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.950
I may be a little jumbled,
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.950
I always feel Relax,

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.950
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.870
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.450
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.450
My Aoki award-winning novelist Mama,
and her chipmunk, Maro-chan.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.450
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.450
The mysterious white bat
straight man, Babbit.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:45.790
Salutations.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:49.460
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:53.760
The man who I declared was my boyfriend,
Take-chan, a.k.a. Gojo Takeshi-san.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.810
I've caught a cold...

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:09.150
You call that a cold!?

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:14.150
"Mixed Feelings About Valentines"

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:17.150
Click...

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.820
♪ Melt plenty of choco-choco in
a huge washtub, choco-tororin, ♪

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:24.490
♪ pour it into the form, choco-toririn,
and you get one huge Sana choco-rin! ♪

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.160
♪ I've decided to make just one,
and give it to only one person. ♪

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.210
--♪ This year, I'm not going to do ♪
--Ah, Sana-chan, is that
valentine's chocolate?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.130
--♪ any drive-by chocolating. ♪
--Ah, Sana-chan, is that
valentine's chocolate?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.800
Oh, Rei-kun, get yours
from Asako-san, okay?

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.800
Huh? How come?

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.260
I've already declared myself
for someone else.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.800
This year, I'm only
giving one to Take-chan.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.470
Aw, I was hoping for one.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:44.140
Don't be a sissy!

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.470
I think I'll go call Asako.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.140
Hmm? Chocolate?

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:50.020
It's chocolate...

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:06.540
I didn't think you'd really
fall for it this year, too.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.120
"He fell for it last year, too?"

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.160
I'm sorry you had to see
something so disgraceful.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.500
What are you doing, Hisae-chan?

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.840
N- n- nothing!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:22.510
Huh? But you must have been watching
something interesting, right?

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.390
No! Absolutely not!

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:34.440
Oho, I think I get it, sir.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.770
W- what?

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.440
You're conspiring to take up tennis, huh?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.900
Thank goodness Sana-chan
is such a dense girl.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:49.450
"Hisae-chan's somewhat unusual behavior"

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.160
Hisae-chan's behavior
is a little unusual, huh?

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.780
This has been true since last episode.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:49.450
When Sana-chan made her remarks
about Gojo-san, Hisae-chan was like...

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.040
That's right!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.790
If you love him, you should be able
to say you love him, huh?

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:58.130
...and as such, took a rather positive
attitude towards Sana-chan's remarks.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:01.550
Also, last time, Hisae-chan's gaze
was unusually dreamy-eyed

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.800
toward this guy playing tennis here.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.140
This is, without a doubt, heh heh...

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.140
Love! Love! Love!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.810
Or, in Japanese, "honoji."

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:17.150
Okay! Okay, Baby's Rock!
Babbit is behind you, Hisae-chan!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:21.070
And so, here is the theme
 of this episode of Kodocha!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.990
"Tomorrow is Valentine's Day
all across Japan"

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.490
Chocolate sellers all over Japan
are jammed with girls,

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.200
and both boys and girls are both
excitedly awaiting the day

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.490
when declarations of love are exchanged.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.830
Such is Valentine's Day.
However, around here...

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.080
D- doesn't matter, huh?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.460
Not in our class.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:41.460
And as for girls likely
to give out chocolates...

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.130
--...there's not a single one.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:49.100
My own little brother is in kindergarten,
and he'll get ten of them.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:53.140
Don't worry, there's always
our ace-in-the-hole, right?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.810
Ace-in-the-hole?

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.810
Kurata's drive-by chocolating.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.110
Drive-by?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:01.280
That's right,
there's always that, huh? Kurata!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.150
Good morning!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.110
Ah, it's Kurata-san.

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.110
It's Kurata-san.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.240
Good morning.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.700
"Drive-by chocolating
has been discontinued"

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.790
--Discontinued!?

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.160
Huh? You were expecting it?
Sorry about that, young ones.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.460
--Why!?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:21.170
Don't cry, guys. You know...
let's go back one year ago!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.800
Take it! Take it! Take some chocolate!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.840
Here, have some chocolate!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.800
It's to prevent that kind of tragedy
from happening again.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.760
You mean, it's Sasaki's fault?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.430
--Sasaki!

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.440
Tsuyoshi-kun, you can
look forward to tomorrow.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.690
Wow, thank you, Aya-chan.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.770
We're the only ones in the class
who are this happy, huh?

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.360
That's right.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.110
Aah! Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.450
Aah, Akito-kun!

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.780
It's your own fault.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:53.450
You'll have to pardon me.
This year, I have a boyfriend, you see.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:57.120
Geez, who's the jerk who thought up
the idea of Valentine's, anyhow?

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.040
I'd like to pound his face.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.590
"Zenjiro's Child's Toy"

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.470
Thank you!

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.800
What are the dirty hands for?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.800
We're not shooting tomorrow,
so I'll take mine today.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.140
I don't have any chocolate.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.480
I've limited it to one person this year.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.480
Oh, I'm glad to hea-uh that.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:24.150
It's bettuh that way. Aftuh all, tomorrow,
I'll be inundated with chocolate.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.820
I've made five appointments
with the dentist. Five of them.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.490
I can't go eating too much chocolate
and get any cavities, aftuh awl.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:33.410
You're a bigger show-off
than I thought, Zenjiro-sensei.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:38.410
Of course I am! Men live for their looks
and their pride! And we bluff, too!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.170
But it's going to be
different for me this year.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:45.420
Lately, I've been snagging
quite a few lady fans' hearts.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.420
True, a lot of them are old ladies.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.840
But I can't keep myself from smiling.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.760
I'm going to be buried unduh
a mountain of chocolate.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:56.470
I will be reporting on Zenjiro-chan's
results tomorrow later on.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:13.910
"Child's Toy Taping"

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:06.440
Huh? Sana-chan! What a coincidence! Me?
I just happened to be passing by.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.450
I'm on my way to trumpet practice.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:10.450
All right!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.910
Huh? Sana-chan... what a coincidence...

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.120
--Nice job, everyone!
--Nice job, everyone!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.120
--H- hey, Sana-chan-
--Ah, Naozumi-kun! It's been so long!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.120
I've decided to give chocolate
to only one person this year.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.460
Naozumi-kun, you're going to get three
whole truckloads from your fans, after all.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.130
You're not expecting
any chocolate at all from me, right?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:30.470
Well, I've got a drama taping
with my boyfriend now, so bye-bye!

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:33.760
I- I'm sure that... I...

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:37.770
I'm sure that it isn't true love!
You just haven't realized it yet!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.430
Yeah, I know! I'll make you to realize it!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.770
She's not here anymore.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.560
Sana-chan, I'd be happier getting
a single chocolate from you

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.150
than three truckloads elsewhere!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.450
Sagami-san?

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.160
Rei-kun feels the same way.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.130
Looks like Take-chan isn't here yet, huh?

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.130
It sure does. Looks like
we're just waiting for Gojo-san.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.130
Hey, isn't he here yet?

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.130
We can't seem to reach him.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.470
Have you gotten
"seriously ill" again, Take-san?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.010
Ill?

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.480
What time is it?

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.400
That's it! Let's start without Gojo-san!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.660
We don't need actors that blow off work!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.240
Oh, no...

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:50.760
Shooting on the drama has
already started, Take-chan!

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:53.420
Say, this serious illness
that Take-chan has...

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.430
It's not life-threatening, right?

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:59.430
No, no, that's not what they mean.
Apparently, he's prone to absenteeism.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.220
I've heard that for a long time,

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.770
he's had a habit of skipping out
on jobs in the middle of them.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:04.770
Oh, no!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.770
Hey, Sana-chan, we're going to do
the next scene without Take-san.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.480
This is bad, Take-chan...

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.820
Stop sniffling! It's packed with germs!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.790
Oh, where's your father today?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:22.790
Work.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.120
Oh, yeah?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.120
Okay!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.130
All right, let's do the
next scene without Take-san!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:31.500
Okay, okay! We can do it without Take-san!

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.550
I've done it again.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.100
Oh well...

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.770
The set is in place, right? Scene 38!

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.780
Okay, Sana-chan, stand by.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.440
All right, let's do it!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.740
Hold on! Hold on a minute, please!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.410
We're pushing it as it is, so we can't.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.780
I'm going to go look for Take-chan!

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.450
I'll be off with a dash,
and come back in a flash!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.120
No, no, we've got no time left at all.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.120
Rei-kun, stall them!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.420
Huh? How?

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.790
On your marks!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:11.790
Get set!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.090
Bang!

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:15.630
Director...

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.100
Take-chan!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.470
This is bad!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:29.150
He's going to get fired
from his job! Take-chan!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.070
Oh, am I on already?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:41.740
"Babbit's drawing song"

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.900
♪ Rice cake, bump, bump,
line, line, triangle, ♪

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.570
♪ raindrop with a heart in it,
draw the wings, ♪

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.740
♪ and it's Babbit! ♪

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:44.790
Take-chan! Don't you run away!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.330
Take-chan!!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.590
There he is!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.590
Way over there?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.260
Take-chan! Oh!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:10:59.930
"Oh" nothing!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.340
Take-chan!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.760
Uh-oh...

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.400
Hey.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.950
I thought you were an Ecchu-Toyama
traveling medicine salesman

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:20.950
for a moment there.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.620
Long ago, they used to peddle
their medicine dressed like this.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:29.500
Let's go back, okay, Take-chan?
Let's just go back.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:35.420
Everyone is waiting for you. Really.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.760
They're waiting for you
to show up, Take-chan.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:44.970
Come on, whoosh off of here at the
next station, and go back with Sana-chan!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:49.980
This train is an express, so it
doesn't stop at the next station.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:55.610
Or the next station,
or the next one, or the next one,

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.980
and the next one, and the next one,
and the next one.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.990
We're not stopping.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.990
"Yug taerg a si rotcerid eht!"

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.330
What did I say?

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:10.330
I don't know what you said.
I want to hurry and start shooting.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.000
What did I say?

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.330
Wah! I give up! I give up! Please tell me!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.000
The Director is a great guy!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.670
See? "The Director is a great guy!"

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.670
Yeah, I really am a great guy.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.380
Okay, next one!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.430
Um...

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.820
I'd like to go see the ocean at night.

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:43.610
This train goes all the way to the ocean.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:48.620
You know something? It's nice to listen
to just the sounds of the waves at night.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:58.710
It feels so refreshing. All the
little things don't matter anymore.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.960
It...

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.970
...must remind you of when you
were inside your mother's tummy.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.310
Take-chan...

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.560
"Rei-kun hard at work"

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.600
Studio crew...

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.310
"Akasaka."

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:15.310
You know what this is when you reverse it?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.650
Akasaka.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.310
See? It's the same!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:23.320
Look, Sagami-chan, I can't keep
the staff waiting any longer.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:27.990
Cutting out Sana-chan's scene
won't have any effect on the story,

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.330
so that's what we'll have to do this time.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.290
What!?

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.620
I'm so hungry! I'm so hungry!
I'm so hungry!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.920
Oh, in that case, you should
have said something sooner!

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.960
I'll go get some
bento lunches ready right now!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.800
No... I... uh... Whose watch is this?

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:51.640
It always ends up like this. Always.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.560
It always has.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:14:00.190
The way I've lived my life
has always been like this.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:09.160
"The way I've lived me life."
Doesn't that sound cool, in my case?

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:16.660
I don't mind it- myself living like this.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:24.340
I've always thought it was good enough.
That it was the only way to go.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.930
But...

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:33.260
...call it ill fortune if you like...

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:38.850
...I've never seen anything
through to the end.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.810
"Rei-kun hard at work"

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:40.810
Studio crew...

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:44.270
Go on, eat, eat!
There's as much as you want!

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.280
Oh, the rest of the staff
is eating too, are you?

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.280
--Oh, yes.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.530
Long ago...

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.960
...there was someone I adored.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:03.540
Someone very dear to me.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.050
Someone I loved.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:12.640
We were both weak people,

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.520
so we each complemented
what the other was missing.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:23.310
By encouraging her,
I was in turn encouraged.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.980
And by being encouraged by her,

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:30.450
I gained the confidence in myself
to face the next day.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.620
And yet...

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.080
I...

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:44.130
...left her behind,
and went to America all alone.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.630
When I did that, I thought
it was for the best.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.590
Right now, America was the only place
where I could improve myself.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.050
Or so I thought.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.760
But...

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:02.310
I left her behind.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:06.150
The one who was so very dear to me.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.950
And so, both of us were hopeless.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:16.330
Even now, I feel the same way about
the results of my actor's training.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.540
And she...

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.960
...the one I loved...

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.790
...is gone now.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:32.630
That's how it feels...
Somehow, that's always how it feels...

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.220
...so I've gotten used to it...

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:48.820
That's how it feels...
no matter what I do...

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.790
"Begging your pardon..."

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.870
Uh, excuse me, Studio crew...

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.290
...and draw in the eye like an arrow.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.630
Let's draw one more arrow.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.300
Now, let's move on to the body!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.970
--It's time for gym, so bring out
the vaulting boxes.
--I can't eat anymore...

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.010
--Sana-chan, this is it.
--Oh, it's better to draw the body

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.760
--I'm all out of material.
--with a bit of a twist here, huh?

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.980
Attention all passengers.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:35.990
Due to a malfunctioning signal, this train
will remain stopped for a brief time.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:41.240
We apologize for any inconvenience
this may cause any passengers.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.250
Due to a malfunctioning signal,

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.040
--this train will remain stopped
--Here it comes...

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.920
--for a brief time.
--Here it comes... Here it comes...

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.920
Here it comes. Here it comes.
Here it comes.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.750
Here it comes! Here it comes!
Here it comes!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.920
Here it comes! Here it comes!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.960
This is no time for the past
to be bugging you,

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.260
and turning you into a bug, Take-chan!

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.930
Ew, I haven't said that
in a long time! Gross!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:02.260
What's important is the present!
Not to mention the future!

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:04.600
You can start working on it right now!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:10.230
Don't forget, Take-chan,
I'm your girlfriend now!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:14.940
Whoo, I hope it isn't broken.
Please, don't let it be!

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:17.950
Take-chan, it's a day early,
but happy Valentine's Day!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.660
See? It's Sana-chan chocolate!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:22.620
Eat it! You'll feel better!
It has my love baked right in!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.950
Go on, bite into the nose here!
Okay? Okay?

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.080
Go on!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.920
Ow! Just kidding!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:39.300
Take-chan... Take-chan, I love you.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:48.940
Right now, Take-chan, I love you.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.270
Oh, yuck!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.320
We're going back, Take-chan!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.940
Uh, ladies and gentlemen,
we're terribly sorry for the inconvenience.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:00.070
Excuse us! We're getting off!

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.290
All right...

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:06.950
All right!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:10.250
I will go back!!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.630
Driver! 800 kph, okay!?

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.300
We'll die!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.630
♪ Nothing will come of
just thinking about it! ♪

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.630
♪ Thinking about it wrong
is just like doing nothing! ♪

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.970
♪ Frogs and crickets are alive! ♪

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.970
♪ Since they're alive,
lots of things happen to them! ♪

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.310
Sorry to keep you!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.310
Sana-chan!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:33.310
Gojo Takeshi has arrived!
I'm terribly sorry for the inconvenience!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:35.900
Sincerely!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.230
--Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.990
F- fine, let's just hurry this up.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.580
Cut! Okay!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:46.910
That's all!?

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:57.920
Now, onto the next day, Valentine's Day!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:00.090
Hey! Hisae-chan!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.930
Huh? Did you just hide something?

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.600
Mm-mm, nothing. Never mind me,
what's in your bundle?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.260
Oh, this? Chocolate!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.930
Huh? I thought you had given up
random acts of chocolate.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.600
I gave up on giving it up.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.690
I learned that just one piece of chocolate

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:17.610
can cheer someone up
enough to change their life.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.280
Yeah, is that right?

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.280
That's right, that's right!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.610
Nobody who gets one
is going to be unhappy!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.240
She's right!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.160
"Hisae-chan sets her mind to it"

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.160
You've worked up the nerve,
huh Hisae-chan?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:34.210
I'm always, always watching you. You look
so handsome when you're playing tennis.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:37.090
Um... please accept this.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.550
I'm a girl...

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.180
"Valentines can be bittersweet"

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.180
H- Hisae-chan?

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:53.600
Here, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.900
I'm so happy! Say, Aya-chan,
one more time.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.900
This will be the eighth time!

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:01.940
But it makes me so happy!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.610
Here, my dear Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:08.580
Wow! This is too good to accept
right away! One more time!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:11.580
For those of you who say
"Do it until you drop dead!"

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:15.250
Geez, I bet all the other classes
are getting all worked up.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.590
I'll buy one for you.
Would you buy one for me?

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.590
Wouldn't that be pointless?

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:23.260
...there are poor guys like these, too,

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.720
and guys who look like it
doesn't matter to them.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.970
Everyone, have some, have some!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.640
Chocolate to make your love,
courage, good cheer and luck bloom!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.310
Oh, there's always Kurata!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.610
All right! Thank you, Kurata!

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.320
Hmph. Idiot.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.530
I should have mentioned it sooner,

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:48.320
but Kurata Sana's first essay
goes on sale tomorrow!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:49.990
Everyone read it!

