00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.510
I'm in a mess. Oh, I'm really in a mess.

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:19.470
For the first time ever,
Sana-chan has run aground.

00:24:19.470 --> 00:24:23.480
The content of my essay really
hurts Mami-chan something terrible.

00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:25.480
Take-chan, help me.

00:24:25.480 --> 00:24:27.940
